content Develop a signal quality scoring system.
	
	## Goal
	Predict which spread signals will lead to profitable trades.
	
	## Features to Consider
	- Deviation magnitude (larger = stronger signal?)
	- Deviation velocity (how fast is spread moving?)
	- Kappa/intensity at signal time
	- Position in price range (disposition)
	- Time since last trade
	- Current inventory level
	
	## Model Options
	- Simple weighted score
	- Logistic regression
	- Decision tree
	
	## Validation
	- Backtest with quality filter
	- Compare high-quality vs low-quality signal outcomes
